      "result": "## Test Execution Complete\n\nI've systematically tested all 18 items in the checklist for the FlexBase database application. Here's the summary:\n\n### Results Overview\n- **PASS**: 11 tests\n- **FAIL**: 7 tests\n\n### Passing Tests (11)\n✅ **FT-2**: Field types can be added with clear type selection (Text, Number, Date, Checkbox)\n✅ **FT-3**: Text, number, date, and checkbox values save correctly in both views\n✅ **FT-4**: View switching preserves all entries and data\n✅ **FT-5**: Independent sort states maintained between table and card views\n✅ **CS-8**: Number field rejects non-numeric input\n✅ **CS-9**: Date field rejects invalid dates\n✅ **CS-11**: Sorting preserves entry count and all field values\n✅ **CS-14**: Field types clearly labeled in configuration dialog\n✅ **CS-15**: Checkbox states clearly distinguish Yes/No\n✅ **IX-17**: Quick search works with case-insensitive matching\n✅ **IX-18**: Sort immediately reorders entries with clear indication\n\n### Failing Tests (7)\n❌ **FT-1**: New entries not persisted after page reload\n❌ **FT-6**: No field-specific filter UI found\n❌ **FT-7**: Manual drag-and-drop reordering not functional\n❌ **FT-19**: No import functionality visible in UI\n❌ **CS-12**: Cannot define field-specific filter criteria\n❌ **CS-13**: Completed checkbox values missing from table view display\n❌ **CS-20**: Search doesn't match formatted dates or checkbox states (only text/numbers)\n\n### Critical Issues\n1. **Data Persistence**: Created entries disappear after page reload\n2. **Missing Features**: Filtering, importing, and manual reordering unavailable\n3. **Display Consistency**: Checkbox column not shown in table view while visible in card view\n4. **Search Limitations**: Only matches text and numeric values, not formatted dates or checkbox states\n\nThe application demonstrates solid foundation for field management and basic data viewing, but requires significant work on persistence, filtering, and complete feature implementation.",
